title: Dialogues_Ralph
---
<<declare $visitedYet = false>>
<<if $dialogPhase == "start" or $dialogPhase == "">>
    <<jump Start>>
<<elseif $dialogPhase == "casual">>
    <<jump Casual>>
<<elseif $dialogPhase == "repeat">>
    <<jump Quest_taken2_repeat>>
<<elseif $dialogPhase == "quest_taken">>
    <<jump Quest_taken>>
<<elseif $dialogPhase == "quest_taken2">>
    <<jump Quest_taken2>>
<<elseif $dialogPhase == "quest_complete">>
    <<jump Quest_Complete>>
<<elseif $dialogPhase == "quest_complete_return">>
    <<jump Quest_Complete_Return>>
<<else>>
    Ralph: What the. The current phase: {$dialogPhase} . Do your job bro.
<<endif>>
===

title: Start
---
<<set $visitedYet to true>>
<<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "NPC">>
???: Oh, hey. Good to see you there.
Ralph: I am Ralph. I'm just chilling here with my book.
Ralph: It's called 'Dead Poets Society'...have you heard of it? It's pretty insteresting.
<<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "PC">>
    -> I have.
            Ralph: That's nice to hear. I haven't seen people reading books today...
            Ralph: If you don't mind, I'd like to have a talk about the book with you someday.
                <<jump Start_2>>
    -> Never heard of.
            Ralph: I see. That's fine. Not a lot of people knows about it today.
            Ralph: But it's a pretty good book. Reading it makes me to look back at my youth...
                <<jump Start_2>>
        
===

title: Start_2
---
Ralph: Well, I am pleased to meet you. Today is pretty chill, so feel free to ask me anything.
<<set $dialogPhase = "casual">>
<<dialogPhaseGetter NPC "casual">>
<<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "return">>
===

title: Casual
---
<<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "npc">>
Ralph: Hey there. What's going on?
    -> Are you living in the house?
        Ralph: I don't. This place is my friend's house. 
        Ralph: He went out to his job, so I'm taking care of his young brother...
        Ralph: But since he doesn't go out often and rarely causes trouble, I decided myself to be out and get some sunshine.
        <<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "return">>
    -> What do you do?
        Ralph: I am a high schooler, senior. I just finished applying to colleges I want to go.
        Ralph: It was tough to take care of both college app and tennis...but it went well, I think.
            -> You play tennis?
                Ralph: I did. I was actually the captain of the US national team for U-17 tornament...
                Ralph: Our team went up to semi-finals, but lost against team Spain, ending in the 3rd place.
                Ralph: More to tell, the brothers living in this house were also tennis players.
                Ralph: They were both in our team, but the older one left for team Spain, and the younger left for team Japan.
                <<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "return">>
    -> Nothing.
        Ralph: Seems you're also free. Let me know if you wanna talk about books.
        <<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "return">>
===

title: Quest_taken
---
<<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "npc">>
Ralph: Hey there. What's going on?
    -> Do you know the password for the pc in the home?
        Ralph: I do...but what's up with it?
            -> Need for opening the closet.
                Ralph: Does Ryoma wants something from inside? Man...
                Ralph: He could've just ask me for...
                <<dialogPhaseGetter NPC "quest_taken2">>
                <<jump Quest_taken2>>
                <<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "return">>
===

title: Quest_taken2
---
Ralph: But you seem pretty trustable. I'll give you the password, make sure you only search for the closet lock.
Ralph: It's 'TREMOR.'
<<dialogPhaseGetter NPC "repeat">>
<<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "return">>
===

title: Quest_taken2_repeat
---
<<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "npc">>
Ralph: Did you forgot the password?
Ralph: Haha, that's ok. The password is 'TREMOR.' All capitalized. 
<<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "return">>
===

title: Quest_Complete
---
<<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "npc">>
Ralph: So, did you unlocked the closet? What's up with that?
    -> There was a tennis ball.
    Ralph: Oh...seems Ryoma was bored.
    Ralph: Did he told you about playing tennis with me?
    Ralph: Well, if he wants, there's no reason for me to hesitate.
    <<dialogPhaseGetter NPC "quest_complete_return">>
    <<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "return">>
===

title: Quest_Complete_Return
---
<<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "npc">>
Ralph: Do you still have any question?
    -> The hoodie...
        Ralph: Yes, it's the star-spangled banner.
        Ralph: In the honor and loyalty to the homeland, I always wear them.
        <<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "return">>
    -> What's up with the brothers?
        Ralph: They might be loose and slacky...but they were our aces in team US.
        Ralph: Even when both left...they carried the whole team to the apex rank.
        Ralph: You won't know it in the first, but they actually get along pretty well.
        Ralph: Ryoga...he cares alot of his brother. Don't know if Ryoma knows that.
        Ralph: Casue he always works hard under Ryoma's sight, haha.
        <<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "return">>
    -> Nothing, see ya.
        Ralph: See you in the tennis court, then.
        <<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "return">>
===